<title>USA: Shiva CFO Deysher resigns.</title>
<headline>Shiva CFO Deysher resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiva Corp said Monday that Cynthia Deysher had resigned as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Larry Whitman, vice president and corporate controller, is serving as the company's principal accounting and finance officer, it said.  </p>
<p>The resignation was announced as Shiva forecast it would not meet analysts' earnings expectations for the first quarter and would sustain a &quot;substantial&quot; loss.</p>
<p>In January Shiva reported 1996 fourth quarter earnings of $0.05 a share, compared to $0.15 a year earlier.</p>
